title: '? Could the old title have been folded under ''health \ jbb'' when you looked?'
pid: ef56e0e2-3992-4121-85cd-562be0894b9a
body: |2-
  If you think so, or cannot remember, nothing will be changed. If you are sure
  it was not folded, say so under this note, and the Emacs client's redraw will
  be examined. If you do not answer, it is taken for a fold, and nothing is built.
